        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Celica",
            "Alright, let's begin the mission briefing. 【kuroname】, are you receiving me?",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Loud and clear.",
            23,
            "Yeah. What's the situation?",
            23
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Celica",
            "Twenty days ago, a massive ice shelf in the Arctic region collapsed. Our preliminary analysis points to the Red Tide flowing into the ocean, which disrupted thermal currents and set off a chain reaction.",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Celica",
            "The resulting fissures are tens of kilometers deep. Multiple coastal ports have been completely destroyed, displacing tens of thousands of civilians in the area. The World Government is currently leading evacuation and relief efforts.",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Celica",
            "But this disaster has also revealed an enemy we never expected: Sophiasburgh, the former capital of the Arctic Route Union.",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "The former capital?",
            27,
            "Sophiasburgh?",
            27
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Celica",
            "Correct. As you've dealt with them before, you'll recall the Union was once a coalition of powers, similar to Kowloong. Sophiasburgh was its most powerful urban center.",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Celica",
            "It went completely dark during a catastrophic Punishing Virus attack years ago... It seems now it wasn't destroyed; it was entombed beneath the ice this whole time.",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Celica",
            "...As the ice recedes, Sophiasburgh is re-emerging... along with the Corrupted trapped inside. More worryingly, we've detected energy signatures consistent with an Ascendant-level threat.",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Celica",
            "After careful consideration, Babylonia will honor our agreements by deploying roughly a regiment to the Arctic region as reinforcements. Given your experience in polar operations, you'll be among them, 【kuroname】.",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Celica",
            "Your orders are as follows: link up with our advance units and the Union forces, neutralize the Corrupted threat, and ensure the safety of the Union civilians. We're relying on you, 【kuroname】.",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 32,
        "ActionId": 32,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Understood."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 201,
